      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "On the 32.0 RC Testing Guide doc, section 5.4.1's title should be updated to V32 Aliases. Also update the alias from `alias bcli31=...` to `alias bcli32=...`.\n\nhttps://github.com/bitcoin-core/bitcoin-devwiki/wiki/32.0-Release-Candidate-Testing-Guide#541-v31-aliases\n\nAlso, in Section 4 there's a reference to a previous version `v31.2` that should be corrected to `v31.1`.\n\nhttps://github.com/bitcoin-core/bitcoin-devwiki/wiki/32.0-Release-Candidate-Testing-Guide#4-obtain-previous-release",
